00:18:23.780 --> 00:18:30.780
who support my stuff so that millions can enjoy it, and I think it takes a special kind of person to do that, so...

00:18:30.900 --> 00:18:31.620
Thank you.

00:18:31.740 --> 00:18:36.940
And, hey, I guess I can now include my Twitch subs amongst that number, as well.

