Uh, he was responsible for the incredible camera angles, and all of the slow-motion shots, so

00:19:34.620 --> 00:19:36.700
check out his channel in the description,

00:19:36.700 --> 00:19:42.720
and there's also two other lore content creators I wanna shout-out: there's Hawkshaw and Lokey -

00:19:42.720 --> 00:19:47.200
two content creators who really changed the way that I view Izalith,

00:19:47.300 --> 00:19:51.720
and a lot of the conclusions that they draw inspired this video, so -

00:19:52.900 --> 00:19:59.360
I think you guys would particularly enjoy Hawkshaw's video on the demons; I know I've shouted it out before, but that's in the description.

